Error [E0320]: typed collection construction uses `[T]{…}`, not `[T].{…}`
  --> tests/ui/binpat_rest_not_final.jet:2:17
    |
  2 |     data :: [U8].{ 1, 2 }
    |                 ^
 Why: D-LIT-DOT1 drops the constructor dot from every literal head
 Fix: write `[T]{…}`

Error [E0320]: typed pattern construction uses `[U8]{…}`, not `[U8].{…}`
  --> tests/ui/binpat_rest_not_final.jet:4:13
    |
  4 |         [U8].{"{rest:...}{tail:U8}"} -> { print("x") }
    |             ^
 Why: D-LIT-DOT1 drops the constructor dot from every literal head
 Fix: write `[U8]{…}`

Error [E1009]: a `{...}` rest capture must be the last part of a binary pattern
  --> tests/ui/binpat_rest_not_final.jet:4:17
    |
  4 |         [U8].{"{rest:...}{tail:U8}"} -> { print("x") }
    |                 ^^^^^^^^
 Why: the rest capture takes every remaining byte, so nothing can come after it
 Fix: move the `{name:...}` hole to the end, or give it a fixed width
